      "conclusion": "target-anchor",
      "rationale": "Target anchor. The complete source identifies 虨 as one of the prince’s three confined sons, explicitly equates him with Daowen and follows his death with posthumous Nanyang investiture. Earlier Daowen illness and denied title request continue inside the prince’s letter. Preserve all existing flags and hints; no inferred absolute dates are needed.",
