      "conclusion": "same-person",
      "rationale": "The heir’s eldest son 虨 is ill, the heir requests and is refused a princely title and offers prayers; he is then named with Zang and Shang in the Jinyong confinement. This unusual sequence precisely matches Daowen in the target’s letter and the explicit 虨字道文 equation; the paired current English correctly calls him Bin.",
      "primaryUnitCitations": [
        {
          "unitId": "zizhitongjian:083:s0172",
          "zh": "十二月，太子長子虨病，太子為虨求王爵，不許。"
        },
        {
          "unitId": "zizhitongjian:083:s0173",
          "zh": "虨疾篤，太子為之禱祀求福。"
        },
        {
          "unitId": "zizhitongjian:083:s0194",
          "zh": "於是使尚書和郁等持節詣東宮，廢太子為庶人，太子改服出，再拜受詔，步出承華門，乘粗犢車，車武公澹以兵仗送太子及妃王氏、三子虨、臧、尚同幽於金墉城。"
        }
      ],
